    "title": "The 5th Annual Emerald Isle Car Show will be held on Saturday, November 14, 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago The 5th Annual Emerald Isle Car Show will be held on Saturday, November 14, 2026 (Rain date November 21). The car show will be held from 10 a.m. - 2 p.m. at the Western Ocean Regional Access, at 9003 Louise Avenue. Come check out the car show, listen to live music, and peruse raffle items donated by area businesses. There will be no parking for the public at the Western Ocean Regional Access, just for car show participants. Public parking will be available on Islander Drive, and open areas of Reed Drive. Read full article",
    "summary": "1 days ago The 5th Annual Emerald Isle Car Show will be held on Saturday, November 14, 2026 (Rain date November 21). The car show will be held from 10 a.m. - 2 p.m. at the Western Ocean Regional Access, at 9003 Louise Avenue. Come check out the car show, listen to live music, and peruse raffle items donated by area businesses. There will be no parking for the public at the Western Ocean Regional Access, just for car show participants. Public parking will be available on Islander Drive, and open areas of Reed Drive.",
